// Vanilla magazine prices track their compatible weapon's price, not the
// magazine's own value (e.g. mag_akm_drum75rnd cost more than the akm
// rifle itself) - re-priced below purely by round capacity instead, since
// a magazine is a cheap accessory, never a fraction of buying a whole gun.
// NOTE: these bands are pre-multiplier BASE prices - this group's tier is
// Uncommon (BUY_PRICE_MULTIPLIER 1.5x), so real in-trader prices are 1.5x
// each number below (e.g. TINY's 200-367 base becomes a real 300-550).
